#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client so you can run jobs with IBM Quantum Compute Service."
msgstr "Instale o cliente IBM Quantum Compute para executar jobs com o IBM Quantum Compute Service."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client"
msgstr "Instalar o cliente IBM Quantum Compute"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore manylinux miniconda */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore manylinux miniconda */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install the IBM Quantum Compute client {#install-the-ibm-quantum-compute-client}"
msgstr "Instalar o cliente IBM Quantum Compute {#install-the-ibm-quantum-compute-client}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum Compute Service is the cloud-based service for executing quantum computations on IBM Quantum&reg; hardware. This guide shows you how to install `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, which is the client package for accessing IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"
msgstr "O IBM Quantum Compute Service é o serviço baseado em nuvem para executar computações quânticas no hardware IBM Quantum&reg;. Este guia mostra como instalar o `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, que é o pacote cliente para acessar o IBM Quantum Compute Service.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Before installing the `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, follow the instructions in these guides:\n"
msgstr "Antes de instalar o `qiskit-ibm-runtime`, siga as instruções nestes guias:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Install Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit). \n"
msgstr "[Instalar o Qiskit](/guides/install-qiskit).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Set up your IBM Cloud account](cloud-setup).\n"
msgstr "[Configurar sua conta IBM Cloud](cloud-setup).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run this command to install the IBM Quantum Compute client:\n"
msgstr "Execute este comando para instalar o cliente IBM Quantum Compute:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Stay current with the latest versions\">\n"
"Periodically check the [`qiskit-ibm-runtime` release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) to see new releases. We recommend frequently updating your requirements for `qiskit-ibm-runtime` by running `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Mantenha-se atualizado com as versões mais recentes\">\n"
"Verifique periodicamente as [notas de lançamento do `qiskit-ibm-runtime`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/release-notes) para ver novos lançamentos. Recomendamos atualizar frequentemente seus requisitos para `qiskit-ibm-runtime` executando `pip install -U qiskit-ibm-runtime`.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Próximos passos {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"  - [Install the Qiskit SDK from source](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Run your first program](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Try a tutorial, such as [Grover's algorithm](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"  - Review the [deprecation policy](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recomendações\">\n"
"  - [Instalar o SDK Qiskit a partir do código-fonte](/guides/install-qiskit-source).\n"
"  - [Execute seu primeiro programa](/guides/hello-world).\n"
"  - Experimente um tutorial, como o [Algoritmo de Grover](/tutorials/grovers-algorithm).\n"
"  - Revise a [política de descontinuação](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-ibm-runtime/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
